IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pua-water-offences`

-- Public Utilities Act 2001, ss 25, 40G, 40H, 44E, 44J, 45A, 47, 47A, 50, 56A, 57, 58, 59 and 68B -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_public-utilities-act-2001.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

